### Collections — CREATE (expects 201 Created; recycler and route must be active)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@recyclerId = 1
@routeId = 1

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jornada Ruta Centro 2026-10-01",
  "recyclerId": {{recyclerId}},
  "routeId": {{routeId}},
  "collectionDate": "2026-10-01",
  "description": "Recolección de cartón y PET en el centro",
  "status": "active"
}

### Collections — CREATE without date (defaults to today) (expects 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jornada de hoy",
  "recyclerId": {{recyclerId}},
  "routeId": {{routeId}}
}

### Collections — CREATE with a future date (expects 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jornada futura",
  "recyclerId": {{recyclerId}},
  "routeId": {{routeId}},
  "collectionDate": "2099-01-01"
}

### Collections — CREATE same recycler, route and date (expects 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jornada repetida",
  "recyclerId": {{recyclerId}},
  "routeId": {{routeId}},
  "collectionDate": "2026-10-01"
}
